description "Kowakian Monkey-Lizard

Cackling pests with nothing better to do than annoy anyone they see. Heard any good jokes lately?

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- Foraged E-11 Blaster Rifle (DC Carb 1)
-- 18% more damage
-- 50% more velocity
-- 175% slower RoF
-- 10% slower mag reload
- ... (6) (Rock)
-- Poisons/focuses on hit
-- 2900% more damage
-- 10% faster RoF
-- 1400% larger splash
-- Primary fire only
- Foraged Class B Frag Grenade (1)
-- 28% smaller splash
-- Primary fire only

^5Powers:
- Animal Instinct (Sense 1)

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (2)
- Stamina (2)
- Dexterity (1)
- Strength (1)
- Assemble (2)
- 10% less knockback given
- 40% more knockback taken
- 75% slower skill cooldown

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Infectious Laughter ^3[Taunt Jedi]

Turn over for nutritional information."